<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 222 AT TEA ON 3RD DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA ALL OUT FOR 222 AT TEA ON 3RD DAY.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were all out for 222 at tea on Sunday on the third day of the first cricket test and face following on after trailing New Zealand by 364 runs in the first innings.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 586 for seven declared (B.Young 267 not out). Sri Lanka 222 (S.Doull 5-58).</p>
